  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "Yo-Na believes a “Power Top” is the key to his happiness. He’s suppressed his gangster nature for years, posing as a delicate flower to catch \"the one.\" When he sees the handsome, masculine Ro-Hyun at a dessert shop, he thinks he’s hit the jackpot. Unfortunately, Ro-Hyun is actually the sweetest, gentlest soul on earth. Now, Yo-Na is on a mission of blood, sweat, and tears to man up this sweet cinnamon roll. It’s a hilarious battle of wills as a fake flower tries to force a fake hunk to grow some balls.\n\n(Source: Tappytoon, edited)",
